From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:21:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Include <type_traits> where XAsync.cpp uses it.

XAsync.cpp uses std::alignment_of and std::is_trivially_destructible but relies on another
header for <type_traits>: libstdc++ provides it that way, LLVM's libc++ does not.

Original work for macrock (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Topic: clang-build
---
 src/System/Threading/XAsync.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/System/Threading/XAsync.cpp b/src/System/Threading/XAsync.cpp
index 2d73842b2d87256c46113fc3c87db06fbf52bd30..49ae8bcd61ce611b0a142a0feaf0ca322526f547 100644
--- a/src/System/Threading/XAsync.cpp
+++ b/src/System/Threading/XAsync.cpp
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
 
 #include <atomic>
 #include <condition_variable>
+#include <type_traits>
 
 // Signatures can be anything because these are not exposed to the client.
 #define ASYNC_BLOCK_SIG         0x41535942 // ASYB
